17:03:53Z","updated_at":"2025-10-07T17:03:53Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3377772747/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3465299009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107384#issuecomment-3465299009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107384","id":3465299009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OjERB","user":{"login":"dog-on-moon","id":159832633,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYbaOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159832633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/dog-on-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T23:55:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T23:55:35Z","body":"so i believe this PR breaks materials w/ `blend_mode add` in certain conditions?\r\n\r\n| directional light disabled | directional light enabled |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"715\" height=\"387\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d7a0652-e876-4c56-b6e9-98ce35588410\" />  | <img width=\"664\" height=\"410\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b83d7156-05c1-467b-b143-a2e15819945d\" />  |\r\n\r\nthis scene already has a directional light, but I wanted to add a second one for just the player models to make them brighter. while it does make the player brighter, it seems to have an impact on other shaders, such as breaking the cutoff effect on this enemy arrow\r\n\r\n> the arrow is just a super long arrow mesh that disables its alphas after a certain threshold\r\n> \r\n> <img width=\"1248\" height=\"806\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/087e675b-5a72-44f3-9f25-198f4518de5a\" />\r\n\r\nalso noticing that it sometimes breaks one of my battle particle emitters (which also uses `blend_mode add`):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"266\" height=\"506\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78f11af4-0ec9-4ac8-b742-b637f37243a2\" />\r\n\r\n(i can't seem to get an MRP for this, since it happens kinda unreliably and I can't replicate it in the editor, but it's 100% caused by toggling the culling light)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3465299009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3466561688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107384#issuecomment-3466561688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107384","id":3466561688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7On4iY","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/